# An allowlist, not a denylist: the build context is only what the image
# needs. Anything new in the repo stays out until it is added here on purpose.
*
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!maskerade/
!docker/entrypoint.sh

# Never, even inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.bak
**/*.bak-*
maskerade/stages/_bpe_cache
**/.maskerade
